      <title>Lily Mara 演讲：通过增量 FFI 重构在现有代码库中逐步集成 Rust 以加速性能</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260910/Lily-Mara-%E6%BC%94%E8%AE%B2%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%A2%9E%E9%87%8F-FFI-%E9%87%8D%E6%9E%84%E5%9C%A8%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E5%BA%93%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E9%9B%86%E6%88%90-Rust-%E4%BB%A5%E5%8A%A0%E9%80%9F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD/</link>
